# Club & Grub - level texts of world 5, Sunbaked Canyon (Book II), and Feast Land D, English. Owner: level designer
# D5 (docs/expansion/PLAN.md 6.1). A level sub-catalogue: loaded beside locale/en.po (scripts/ui/ui_kit.gd), never
# offered as a language. Keys: the level names and the `text=` keys of signs and hint zones of levels/w5_*.lvl,
# levels/bonus_d.lvl and their co-op files. Every sign text takes at most 3 board lines (SignBoard.MAX_LINES, about
# 60 characters; LEVEL_DESIGN.md 15.6 [G27]).
